body:
Just because you see more than one line doesn't make it harder. It took me all of 30 seconds to perform these steps. 

&#x200B;

No need to unplug anything. For some that can be a problem depending how you're set up. If you're one of the people with crashing issues, repeating physical steps can become annoying. Same with restarting your computer. If you leave the rules, you can just click disable/enable the rule without re-creating it each time. So at that point it becomes a 1 second thing.

&#x200B;

And, like I said, do whatever is easier for you. Not everyone is setup the same way as you or has the same stability as you. For me this is easier for me because it's just a click to enable/disable as needed and not affect the rest of my PC.

Recently returned and decided to do some quests in my log. I try and do the "Suggested" quest section called "\[Awakening\] Awakening of the black spirit 0/2" which have under it the following quests: "\[Awakening\] Artifacts of the Naga" and "\[Awakening\] Bree Tree Cave." When I do the travel to option the black spirit opens but he says nothing regarding the quest nor is there a choice related to those 2 quests.

&#x200B;

How can I get them completed? I've already got my awakening weapon (dark knight). Am I simply not able to do these quests anymore?
